---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { practice } from '../data/practice';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Website Disclaimer"
  description="Website privacy practices, medical disclaimer, and terms governing use of the Naples Modern Choice Medicine website."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Website information"
    title="Privacy & website disclaimer"
    intro="This page explains how this informational website operates, how external services are handled, and the limits that apply when using its content."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <p class="effective-date">
        <strong>Effective September 15, 2026</strong>
      </p>

      <h2>Website privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This is a public, informational website. It does not provide account
        registration, online appointment booking, medical intake forms, a custom
        contact form, on-site payment processing, advertising, or
        practice-operated analytics. The practice does not intentionally collect
        medical or payment information through this website.
      </p>
      <p>
        The website's hosting provider may automatically process technical
        information associated with a visit, such as an IP address, device or
        browser information, referring page, requested pages, and the date and
        time of a request. The hosting provider's own privacy terms govern its
        processing of that information.
      </p>

      <h2>Medical information and emergencies</h2>
      <p>
        Website content is provided for general educational and practice
        information only. It is not medical advice and must not be used as a
        substitute for professional diagnosis, treatment, or advice from a
        qualified health care professional who understands your individual
        circumstances.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website and the listed email address are not monitored for urgent
        needs and must not be used for medical emergencies. Call 911 or go to
        the nearest emergency department if you are experiencing a medical
        emergency.
      </p>

      <h2>No patient-provider relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Viewing this website, following a link, calling the office, or sending
        an email does not by itself create a patient-provider relationship. A
        patient-provider relationship is established only through the practice's
        applicable acceptance and care process.
      </p>

      <h2>Email and personal information</h2>
      <p>
        Email may not be a secure or appropriate way to send medical, financial,
        insurance, or other sensitive personal information. Do not send
        sensitive information through the listed email address unless the
        practice has specifically instructed you to do so. Contact the office
        for an approved method of communication when sensitive information is
        required.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website policy describes the public website only. It is not the
        practice's Notice of Privacy Practices concerning protected health
        information. A copy of any applicable Notice of Privacy Practices may be
        requested directly from the practice.
      </p>

      <h2>Payments and third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Member payments are handled by the external PayerExpress payment portal.
        The practice website does not receive or store payment-card or
        bank-account information entered on that portal. Directions are provided
        through Google Maps, and email links open the visitor's own email
        service. Third-party services operate under their own terms, security
        practices, and privacy policies.
      </p>
      <p>
        A link to another website is provided for convenience and does not mean
        that Naples Modern Choice Medicine controls, guarantees, or endorses
        that website's content, availability, privacy, or security.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy, availability, and changes</h2>
      <p>
        The practice makes reasonable efforts to present accurate and current
        information, but website content may contain errors, become outdated, or
        change without notice. Services, membership availability, policies, and
        other practice information should be confirmed directly with the office.
        The practice does not guarantee that the website will always be
        available, uninterrupted, secure, or free of technical errors.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, this website and its
        content are provided “as is” and “as available,” without warranties of
        any kind, express or implied. No statement on this website guarantees a
        particular medical, financial, or other outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Naples Modern Choice
        Medicine and its owners, clinicians, employees, and agents are not
        liable for losses or damages arising from access to, inability to
        access, use of, or reliance on this website or linked third-party
        services. Nothing in this disclaimer excludes or limits a right, duty,
        remedy, or liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.
      </p>

      <h2>Permitted use</h2>
      <p>
        The website may be used for lawful, personal, informational purposes.
        Its text, branding, photographs, and other content may not be copied,
        misrepresented, distributed, or commercially exploited without
        permission, except as allowed by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Applicable law and policy updates</h2>
      <p>
        Use of this website is governed by applicable federal law and the laws
        of the State of Florida, without limiting any protections or remedies
        that cannot legally be waived. This page may be updated as the website,
        services, hosting, or legal requirements change. The effective date
        above identifies the current version.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this website policy may be directed to Naples Modern
        Choice Medicine at <a href={practice.phone.href}
          >{practice.phone.display}</a
        > or <a href={practice.email.href}>{practice.email.display}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .effective-date {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
</style>
